{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04430","headline":"答洛阳主人 · 陈子昂","name":"答洛阳主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生白云志，早爱赤松游。\n事亲恨未立，从宦此中州。\n主人亦何问，旅客非悠悠。\n方谒明天子，清宴奉良筹。\n再取连城璧，三陟平津侯。\n不然拂衣去，归从海上鸥。\n宁随当代子，倾侧且沈浮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}